  "nextHypothesis": "Test a single authoring instruction that (a) states the requirement acronym derivation and (b) fixes where a shared Input/Outcome table sits relative to REQUIREMENT_ENTRY_FORMAT entries; predict one fewer failed check plus one fewer whole-file rewrite, without touching whole-write semantics."
